              "id": "1,",
              "title": "Survey Customization and Targeting",
              "description": "Users frequently inquire about customizing surveys based on product purchases, customer tags, or segments such as new vs returning customers. There is also interest in conditional logic for surveys to adapt questions dynamically based on previous answers."
            },
            {
              "id": "2,",
              "title": "Integration and Data Export",
              "description": "Many customers seek guidance on integrating survey responses with platforms like Klaviyo, Google Sheets, and Slack. They also want to understand how to export data, automate workflows, and ensure seamless data syncing for marketing and analysis purposes."
            },
            {
              "id": "3,",
              "title": "Technical Issues and Survey Visibility",
              "description": "There are reports of surveys not showing on checkout or thank you pages, issues with post-purchase surveys after Shopify updates, and problems with exit intent surveys on mobile. Customers request troubleshooting help and advice on ensuring reliable survey display."
            },
            {
              "id": "4,",
              "title": "Branding and Subscription Management",
              "description": "Users express interest in removing or customizing Zigpoll branding on surveys, understanding subscription limits and billing, managing user access, and requesting features such as plan upgrades, auto-upgrades, and pausing subscriptions without data loss."
            }
          ],
          "accountId": "789",
          "pollId": "101"
        }
      ],
      "hasNextPage": true,
